"},{"text":"Chemical-dose optimisation"},{"text":"Membrane fouling prediction"},{"text":"Energy optimisation"},{"text":"Equipment failure prediction"},{"text":"Automated process control"},{"text":"Leak detection"},{"text":"Treatment-performance forecasting"},{"text":"Digital twins of treatment plants"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The engineer remains responsible for process safety, treatment reliability, regulatory compliance, engineering judgement, emergency response and technology selection."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"p","text":"Water Science\n→ Water Chemistry + Microbiology + Hydrology + Water Quality"},{"type":"p","text":"Treatment\n→ Coagulation + Filtration + Biological Treatment + Disinfection + Membranes"},{"type":"p","text":"Design\n→ Hydraulics + Pumps + Process Design + Equipment Selection"},{"type":"p","text":"Advanced Technology\n→ RO + MBR + Advanced Oxidation + Desalination + Water Reuse"},{"type":"p","text":"Digital\n→ SCADA + GIS + Python + Data Analytics + Digital Twins"},{"type":"p","text":"Professional\n→ Environmental Compliance + Safety + Project Management + Technical Reporting"},{"type":"p","text":"Future Technology\n→ AI-Based Optimisation + Smart Water Systems + Resource Recovery + Low-Carbon Treatment"},{"type":"h","text":"Target Profile"},{"type":"flow","items":["Environmental Engineer","Water Treatment Specialist","Process Design Engineer","Smart Water Technology Professional"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This profile provides pathways across municipal water utilities, wastewater-treatment companies, industrial ETPs, engineering consultancies, infrastructure companies, desalination projects, water-reuse organisations and smart-water technology companies."},{"type":"table","header":["253","UG","Engineering & Technology","B.Tech / B.E. (Bachelor of Technology / Engineering)","Naval Architecture & Ship Building","Naval Architect",""],"rows":[]}]}]}